001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TUSECHNG.
001600 AUTHOR.              C HILLES - CONVERTED BY BK DISMUKES.
001700 DATE-WRITTEN.        APRIL, 1982 - CONVERTED NOVEMBER, 1992.
001800 DATE-COMPILED.
001900*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
002000*SECURITY.
001400*REMARKS.     ONLINE UPDATE OF MONTHLY USAGE HISTORY.
001410**************************************************************
001411*   10/15/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
001412*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
001413*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
001414*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
001415*             CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,*
001416*             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.                          *
001417*             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE    *
001418*             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.         *
001419*                                             PD RAGLOW.     *
001420**************************************************************
001421*C
001421*C  11-03-92   BK DISMUKES   REQUEST# 6241
001421*C      1. CONVERTED FROM HP TO AS/400.
001421*C
      *C   07MAR1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS-400.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT USAGEFIL
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSUSAG
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUSECHNG-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

002500 DATA DIVISION.
002600 FILE SECTION.

       FD  USAGEFIL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  USAGEFIL-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCSUSAG OF MCFLCSUSAG.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF ZUSECHNG.

002700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
